{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"c71745e8-04cd-464d-b30e-de9797de9727","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the required analytics events:\n\n### **Registration Screen (`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`)**\n- Imported the analytics wrapper.\n- Added flags to fire events only once per screen visit.\n- Captured:\n  - `registration_email_started`\n  - `registration_phone_started`\n  - `loan_amount_changed` (on slider release)\n  - `terms_accepted` (first acceptance)\n  - `registration_continue_tapped` (with amount \u0026 terms)\n- Updated UI callbacks to set flags and send events.\n\n### **Offers Screen (`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`)**\n- Imported the analytics wrapper.\n- Wrapped the list in `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` to capture `offers_scrolled` with scroll offset.\n\n### **Relevant Parts from Colleague’s Note Applied**\n- **One‑time flags** for text fields to avoid per‑keystroke events.\n- **`onChangeEnd`** for slider to capture a single event per drag.\n- **`ScrollEndNotification`** for scroll tracking.\n- Preserved original event names and properties per the spec.\n\nAll changes are reflected in the updated files. 🎉\n","duration_seconds":200.404063,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":46312,"output_tokens":20798,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":737536,"total_tokens":67110}}}
